{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組一般選舉早上9時開始投票。截至早上11時，投票率69.61%， 3974名選民投票。<br/>\n<br/>\n其中商界（第三）投票率最高，有100%，界別內的113名選民已全部投票。其次是漁農界。<br/>\n<br/>\n投票率最低是社會福利界，有40.49%，66人已投票，界別選民人數有163人。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T04:02:42.383593+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T03:17:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T05:48:16.796969+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T03:56:15.085710+00:00","content_hash":"350d9dd52afe07c752d18974f1b8cf5c271798f7cb2b88c4eb3331b9e7c746b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}